{"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameMain"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"title":"main()","role":"symbol","extendedModule":"Gnusto","modules":[{"name":"Gnusto"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method","externalID":"s:6Gnusto8GameMainPA2A0B0RzrlE4mainyyYaFZ","conformance":{"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}],"constraints":[{"code":"Self","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Game","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},"symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"main"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/GameMain\/main()","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnusto\/gamemain\/main()"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"main"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Bootstrap failures (an invalid game definition) are reported to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"standard error and exit the process with a nonzero status, the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as a hand-written ","type":"text"},{"code":"main.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" would.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"--mcp","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (or ","type":"text"},{"code":"GNUSTO_MCP","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") takes the other branch entirely: the process","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"becomes a play-test server speaking MCP on stdio and never builds a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"world here, because the server builds one ","type":"text"},{"code":"PreparedGame","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and spins a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"world per session. Since every game is ","type":"text"},{"code":"@main struct G: Game, GameMain","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"putting the switch here makes every game that has ever been written","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with this engine — including one whose author has never heard of the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"play-test harness — reachable by an agent for the cost of one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":".mcp.json","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" entry. See ","type":"text"},{"code":"PlaytestMode","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"PlaytestServer.serve","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That branch exists only when the package’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Playtest"},{"type":"text","text":" trait is enabled,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which it is by default. Without it the harness is not in the binary and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the request is refused on standard error, rather than answered by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"playing the game at a client writing JSON-RPC into its stdin."}]}]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The entry point Swift’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@main"},{"type":"text","text":" attribute calls. Builds the world"}